OL,3,GNEWSACharity aid bus travels to Ukraine
OL,4,Afor evacuations
OL,5,
OL,6,FA convoy of vehicles filled with
OL,7,Fhumanitarian aid has set off from Devon
OL,8,Fto Ukraine.
OL,10,FOne of the vehicles from Bob the Bus, a
OL,11,FTotnes-based charity providing free
OL,12,Fservices through the town, will remain
OL,13,Fin Ukraine to help with evacuations.
OL,15,FRichard Stout, who is driving the
OL,16,Fyellow bus, said he was leading the
OL,17,Fconvoy that set off on Wednesday
OL,18,Fmorning from Stoke Gabriel. He admitted
OL,19,Fhe felt nervous because last time the
OL,20,Fbus tried to take make the journey it
OL,21,Fbroke down.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
