OL,3,GNEWSACharity aid bus travels to Ukraine
OL,4,Afor evacuations
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe will drive the vehicle to Poland
OL,7,Fwhere he will be met by Adam Stewart,
OL,8,Ffrom Ukranian Action Team Devon, who
OL,9,Fwill then drive it to Kharkiv in
OL,10,FUkraine.
